---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">

<section class="policy">

<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>
This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website.
By using this website, you agree to the practices described in this policy.
</p>

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>
We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring transparency in how your data is handled.
This website provides independent reviews of digital tools such as hosting services, VPNs, and WordPress-related products.
</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>
We may collect limited information in the following ways:
</p>
<ul>
<li>Information you voluntarily provide (e.g. via contact form)</li>
<li>Basic technical data (IP address, browser type, device)</li>
<li>Anonymous usage data (pages visited, time spent)</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
<p>
We use collected information to:
</p>
<ul>
<li>Improve website performance and user experience</li>
<li>Respond to user inquiries</li>
<li>Analyze traffic and content effectiveness</li>
<li>Ensure website security</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
<p>
We use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your browsing experience and analyze traffic.
Cookies may be used to remember preferences and track anonymized usage data.
</p>

<p>
You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.
</p>

<h2>5. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
<p>
Some links on this website are affiliate links. This means we may earn a commission if you click a link and make a purchase,
at no additional cost to you.
</p>

<p>
This helps support the website and allows us to continue providing free content and reviews.
</p>

<h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>
We may use third-party tools for analytics and website functionality.
These services may collect anonymized data in accordance with their own privacy policies.
</p>

<p>
We do not control how third-party services process your data.
</p>

<h2>7. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
<p>
We do not sell, trade, or rent personal information to third parties.
</p>

<p>
We may share limited data only when required by law or to protect our rights.
</p>

<h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
<p>
We retain data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy.
</p>

<h2>9. Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
<p>
If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have the right to:
</p>
<ul>
<li>Access your personal data</li>
<li>Request correction or deletion</li>
<li>Restrict or object to processing</li>
<li>Request data portability</li>
</ul>

<p>
To exercise your rights, you can contact us via email.
</p>

<h2>10. Data Security</h2>
<p>
We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information.
However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.
</p>

<h2>11. Children's Information</h2>
<p>
This website is not intended for children under the age of 13.
We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.
</p>

<h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
</p>

<h2>13. Contact Information</h2>
<p>
If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at:
</p>

<p class="contact-email">
contact@techtoolreviews.com
</p>

</section>

<style>

.policy{
max-width:900px;
margin:60px auto;
padding:40px;
background:white;
border-radius:12px;
box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}

.policy h1{
text-align:center;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

.policy h2{
margin-top:30px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.policy p{
color:#555;
line-height:1.7;
}

.policy ul{
margin-left:20px;
color:#555;
}

.contact-email{
margin-top:10px;
font-weight:bold;
color:var(--cta);
}

</style>

</Layout>